{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-27T07:28:33.332Z","data":{"text":"Task 1 complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the dispatch-item derivation layer for `osq inbox`:\n\n**`src/core/status/dispatch-items.ts`** (new)\n- `readDispatchItems(projectRoot, config)` derives `{ watcherIdle, items }` read-only from `getStatusOverview`.\n- Item kinds: `approval`, `halt`, `land`, `verify`, each carrying the change ref (`id`, `folder`, `title`, `folderPath`), optional task ref, and exact commands osq already has.\n- Items sorted numeric change order, then task order (change-level before its tasks).\n- `watcherIdle` true when no active change's next step is `running`.\n\n**`src/core/status/dispatch-land.ts`** (new)\n- `findLandCandidates` selects `Vcs` once, returns nothing under `NoVcs`.\n- `vcs.enabled`: archived changes in osq worktree trees whose `readDependencyState` is `archived`.\n- flag off: root archive folders git status lists as untracked/modified, itself or under it.\n\n**`tests/dispatch-items.test.ts`** (new) covers every \"Dispatch items\" scenario: each kind, unplanned draft, state follow-through, change regression, untracked archive (flag off), no-git, watcher idle, and the real worktree archive until a squash merge lands it (helpers copied from `tests/stack-run.test.ts`).\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify: `node --import tsx --test tests/dispatch-items.test.ts` → 8 pass, 0 fail.\n- Proposal verify: `pnpm verify` → typechecks, build, full suite, and lint all pass.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/097-inbox-dispatch-order/.run/results/1.md`.\n\n`Touched: src/core/status/dispatch-items.ts, src/core/status/dispatch-land.ts, tests/dispatch-items.test.ts`"}}
